# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of who commits from where.
# This matters beyond tidiness: a CRLF line ending inside a `run:` block in a
# GitHub Actions workflow makes the Ubuntu runner fail with "$'\r': command not
# found", which reads as a broken script rather than a line-ending problem.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.ini  text eol=lf
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.png  binary
